                                        "entry_id": "a7e0982e-1991-31d0-85b0-616c267eba49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A class of steroid hormones that promote growth of tissue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e5b18ae-8f90-4ab8-8520-6eacb4340369",
                                                "sense_id": "406b9935-2acc-3862-991e-a922d374de74",
                                                "text": "Men may also have fertility challenges, especially if their hypogonadism was caused by anabolic steroid use. Anabolic steroids can affect testicular health, including reducing the production of sperm."
